WEBVTT

01:30.880 --> 01:31.550
<i>Mm-hm.</i>

01:31.550 --> 01:34.040
<i>I'm quite adorable.</i>

01:34.040 --> 01:38.910
<i>It might be enough to make Akutsu 
fall head-over-heels for me.</i>

01:38.910 --> 01:41.780
<i>That would make things so much easier for me.</i>

01:42.290 --> 01:43.260
Okay.

01:44.530 --> 01:47.950
<i>But an hour later, Amane was flustered.</i>

01:47.950 --> 01:54.170
<i>Because Akutsu, who was sitting next to her, 
was more dazzling than ever.</i>

01:54.620 --> 01:57.100
<i>How is he so sparkly?</i>

01:57.100 --> 01:59.310
<i>I've never seen him like this before.</i>

01:59.310 --> 02:01.130
<i>No... I have.</i>

02:01.970 --> 02:04.540
<i>I recognize this Akutsu.</i>

02:06.150 --> 02:07.100
What's wrong?

02:08.430 --> 02:09.940
We're in class.

02:09.940 --> 02:11.370
<i>I knew it!</i>

02:11.370 --> 02:13.630
<i>He's challenging me!</i>

02:13.630 --> 02:16.200
<i>I didn't expect him to be this much of a fool!</i>

02:17.060 --> 02:18.700
Looks like I'm up.

02:18.700 --> 02:20.400
No, that won't be necessary.

02:20.400 --> 02:23.180
I'll merely do as I've said I would.

02:23.580 --> 02:25.800
So, do you want this to be activated?

02:25.800 --> 02:27.000
Well? Well?

02:30.570 --> 02:32.250
<i>He scoffed at me!</i>

02:32.250 --> 02:33.930
<i>At me! An angel!</i>

02:33.930 --> 02:36.200
Oh, my, is that all you've got?

02:36.200 --> 02:38.000
I thought you were an angel!

02:38.000 --> 02:40.090
<i>That's probably what he's thinking!</i>

02:40.770 --> 02:42.470
Hang on!

02:42.470 --> 02:44.350
Akutsu-kun!

02:45.080 --> 02:48.840
Hey, do you know where Shiromura-sensei is?

02:50.210 --> 02:53.610
<i>How do you like this cutesy act?</i>

02:54.920 --> 02:57.690
Bring it on, Joe!

02:57.690 --> 03:02.110
Thiam closes in! Can he get a handle on Joe?

03:02.110 --> 03:04.160
I'm going quick this time!

03:04.160 --> 03:06.040
Let's see if you can keep up!

03:07.880 --> 03:09.870
He went to the staff office earlier.

03:11.300 --> 03:13.130
It did nothing!

03:13.130 --> 03:14.670
R-Really?

03:14.670 --> 03:15.600
Thanks!

03:15.600 --> 03:16.630
Bye!

03:17.190 --> 03:18.440
<i>Something's wrong.</i>

03:18.440 --> 03:22.140
<i>He didn't react to my mega-cute display at all.</i>

03:22.640 --> 03:24.760
<i>Maybe the angle was wrong.</i>

03:24.760 --> 03:27.630
<i>Or maybe it wasn't smooth enough.</i>

03:27.630 --> 03:30.180
<i>It's true that it's been a while...</i>

03:33.010 --> 03:34.330
It's Amane-chan.

03:34.330 --> 03:35.610
She's so cute.

03:35.610 --> 03:37.000
Hello!

03:37.000 --> 03:38.530
H-Hello!

03:40.200 --> 03:42.360
<i>I haven't lost my edge.</i>

03:42.360 --> 03:44.560
<i>I guess it was a fluke.</i>

03:44.560 --> 03:45.530
<i>Now...</i>

03:48.290 --> 03:50.330
My hair's in the way...

03:50.680 --> 03:53.210
Yeah? That sucks.

03:53.670 --> 03:56.650
The jabs come out like a Gatling gun!

03:56.650 --> 04:00.050
But he's dodging every hit!

04:00.050 --> 04:02.510
It's so hot again...

04:03.020 --> 04:04.590
Let's go get some water.

04:04.590 --> 04:06.010
<i>He's looking away again.</i>

04:06.330 --> 04:09.850
A swift feint into a right!

04:09.850 --> 04:11.440
No hit!

04:11.440 --> 04:13.850
Is there nothing Thiam can do?!

04:13.850 --> 04:16.360
<i>Nothing's working on him.</i>

04:16.360 --> 04:18.230
<i>Why isn't he reacting?</i>

04:18.810 --> 04:20.120
Oh, yeah, Amane...

04:21.250 --> 04:22.860
Are you not tying your hair back anymore?

04:24.770 --> 04:27.280
The ponytail looked really nice on you.

04:29.880 --> 04:32.410
Thiam's forced to pull back!

04:32.410 --> 04:34.250
Does he need to regroup?

04:34.680 --> 04:37.250
Wait, not a moment to lose!

04:37.750 --> 04:40.090
Joe gets in!

04:40.680 --> 04:42.590
Darn it!

04:44.590 --> 04:46.840
But there's the gong!

04:46.840 --> 04:49.450
Thiam manages to avoid defeat!

04:53.380 --> 04:57.050
<i>Th-That was close!</i>

04:57.050 --> 04:59.770
<i>It wasn't a mistake, after all!</i>

04:59.770 --> 05:05.110
<i>Amane wasn't aware at the time that she 
was falling right into Akutsu's plan.</i>

05:06.280 --> 05:08.990
<i>It looks like I don't have a choice.</i>

05:15.160 --> 05:16.890
<i>Akutsu...</i>

05:16.890 --> 05:19.240
<i>You've only got yourself to blame.</i>

05:19.240 --> 05:21.670
<i>You made me angry.</i>

05:32.510 --> 05:34.820
<i>Don't you dare underestimate me!</i>

05:36.480 --> 05:38.270
Look out!

05:38.270 --> 05:40.620
<i>Perfect timing!</i>

05:40.620 --> 05:44.660
<i>It's time for the ultimate weapon: 
The Rom-com Mount!</i>

05:46.740 --> 05:50.830
What's this? Thiam's rocking left and right!

05:50.830 --> 05:52.160
Prepare yourself...

05:52.160 --> 05:53.160
Is this it?

05:53.160 --> 05:56.620
Is it the Dempsey Roll?!

05:57.720 --> 06:01.250
I'll tear you up with my punch!

06:12.180 --> 06:14.030
Were you hurt?

06:14.030 --> 06:17.640
We wouldn't want you to get 
a bruise on your cute face.

06:17.920 --> 06:19.640
<i>Squee!</i>

06:29.720 --> 06:30.860
Are you all right?!

06:31.490 --> 06:34.220
I got countered.

06:35.580 --> 06:37.780
I lost.

06:38.420 --> 06:39.750
Thiam...

06:39.750 --> 06:44.950
That was a close one, but I was one step ahead.

06:46.720 --> 06:49.760
Did you think the same tactic would work twice?

06:51.590 --> 06:54.990
You underestimated me.

06:54.990 --> 06:58.460
And demons as a whole.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.580
I'm sorry!

07:01.580 --> 07:02.690
I'm all right!

07:03.440 --> 07:05.530
No, you aren't.

07:05.530 --> 07:06.900
Let's go to the nurse's office.

07:11.510 --> 07:14.040
<i>I think that worked.</i>

07:14.040 --> 07:16.330
<i>Chief, I'm almost there!</i>

07:16.330 --> 07:19.130
<i>Your subordinate's doing 
everything he can right now!</i>

07:19.660 --> 07:22.440
Akutsu is only getting started.

07:22.440 --> 07:26.840
But as his superior, 
I must check in on him again.

07:27.160 --> 07:30.880
Disguising oneself is 
an essential skill in espionage.

07:30.880 --> 07:34.600
Everything hinges on how well I can blend in.

07:34.890 --> 07:36.010
For example...

07:36.390 --> 07:38.400
Sometimes, I'm an insurance sales agent.

07:38.400 --> 07:39.680
I'll produce a quote!

07:40.060 --> 07:42.410
Other times, I'm a school nurse.

07:42.410 --> 07:43.350
Time for your needle!

07:44.160 --> 07:45.500
And...

07:45.500 --> 07:47.130
This is part of my job.

07:47.130 --> 07:50.110
This has nothing to do with 
my personal tastes or interests.

07:51.090 --> 07:52.620
A perfect disguise!

07:52.620 --> 07:54.380
But if my subordinates were ever to...

07:56.660 --> 07:59.450
Don't worry! I'm tight-lipped!

08:04.500 --> 08:05.960
I'm fine.

08:05.960 --> 08:07.820
It was nothing serious.

08:07.820 --> 08:08.940
Oh?

08:14.850 --> 08:16.320
What?

08:16.320 --> 08:17.930
Nothing, just...

08:20.430 --> 08:22.400
Oh, you want some.

08:22.400 --> 08:23.560
I'll go buy another one.

08:31.340 --> 08:33.320
I-I...

08:34.020 --> 08:36.620
I think this is an indirect...

08:38.850 --> 08:40.780
<i>That must have got you good!</i>

08:40.780 --> 08:44.380
<i>Now, let your little heart explode!</i>

08:45.070 --> 08:46.780
You idiot...

08:49.520 --> 08:52.340
Don't say stuff like that.

08:56.020 --> 08:57.260
Ice!

09:01.590 --> 09:04.180
Y-Yeah...

09:04.600 --> 09:06.270
You're right.

09:06.670 --> 09:08.510
<i>What was that reaction?</i>

09:08.510 --> 09:10.420
<i>I didn't expect that!</i>

09:15.290 --> 09:17.870
<i>Did that wretch do it on purpose?!</i>

09:17.870 --> 09:19.530
<i>Damn it, he got me!</i>

09:19.530 --> 09:21.990
<i>Okay, let's go with this trick again.</i>

09:23.010 --> 09:25.410
<i>I-I can't...</i>

09:25.920 --> 09:27.780
<i>I was trying to get in his head...</i>

09:28.330 --> 09:30.840
<i>And instead, he's gotten in mine!</i>

09:31.490 --> 09:32.550
<i>But...</i>

09:33.690 --> 09:36.140
<i>I can't give up now!</i>

09:36.710 --> 09:38.830
<i>For my own goals!</i>

09:38.830 --> 09:40.480
<i>And most of all...</i>

09:40.480 --> 09:42.100
<i>Because I'm an angel!</i>

09:49.360 --> 09:50.630
Can you do it?

09:50.630 --> 09:52.110
Of course.

09:52.110 --> 09:55.110
This is why I exist.

09:56.350 --> 09:57.340
Thanks.

09:57.340 --> 09:58.880
What, aren't you having any?

09:58.880 --> 09:59.680
I'm good.

09:59.680 --> 10:01.660
I'll buy some later.

10:01.660 --> 10:02.550
Okay.

10:19.530 --> 10:21.140
Oh, no.

10:21.140 --> 10:23.060
I spilled it.

10:27.000 --> 10:27.980
Behold!

10:27.980 --> 10:30.980
Let the beauty of my wet body excite you!

10:40.780 --> 10:42.480
You'll catch a cold.

10:42.480 --> 10:44.020
Keep that on you.

10:46.790 --> 10:48.290
Ah...

10:50.240 --> 10:51.280
It's no use...

10:51.280 --> 10:52.940
I can't win...

10:52.940 --> 10:56.340
Next time, I'll take you down...

10:56.340 --> 10:59.440
And there's the gong!

10:59.440 --> 11:02.600
Thiam just barely survives!

11:04.210 --> 11:06.160
<i>How could this be?</i>

11:06.160 --> 11:12.090
<i>To think neither the almighty Rom-com Mount 
nor the indirect kiss bit would work...</i>

11:13.110 --> 11:16.140
Hey, are you feeling sick?

11:16.140 --> 11:17.660
Are you okay?

11:17.660 --> 11:18.460
Yeah...

11:18.460 --> 11:20.300
I think I'm okay.

11:21.050 --> 11:23.040
Hey, Yuka-chan...

11:23.040 --> 11:27.390
Is there any way to crush a guy's heart?

11:27.390 --> 11:29.260
Crush?!

11:29.790 --> 11:32.960
I-I guess, well...

11:33.720 --> 11:34.630
Oh...

11:35.520 --> 11:36.870
How about this?

11:40.440 --> 11:43.530
Hey, weren't we going demon hunting today?

11:43.530 --> 11:46.600
That was my intent, but I changed my plan.

11:46.600 --> 11:49.020
I don't mind, I guess.

11:49.800 --> 11:52.020
You sure bought a lot, though.

11:52.390 --> 11:54.570
W-We're taking it back to my place.

11:54.570 --> 11:55.820
Your place?!

11:55.820 --> 11:58.420
<i>What is this girl thinking?</i>

11:58.840 --> 12:01.160
<i>Whatever it is, I should stay vigilant.</i>

12:02.070 --> 12:05.200
You've been working quite hard.

12:05.570 --> 12:08.610
I thought I ought to reward you with food, so...

12:09.690 --> 12:11.800
I decided to cook for you.

12:12.580 --> 12:15.020
<i>Yikes, that was close!</i>

12:15.020 --> 12:16.940
<i>I see, so that's your angle.</i>

12:16.940 --> 12:19.500
<i>That isn't going to work on me today, though.</i>

12:19.840 --> 12:22.830
<i>In fact, I'll snap her soul in half!</i>

12:22.830 --> 12:24.010
We're here.

12:27.960 --> 12:28.910
<i>It's huge.</i>

12:28.910 --> 12:30.140
<i>It's way too huge!</i>

12:30.490 --> 12:32.920
<i>It's nothing like my apartment.</i>

12:39.300 --> 12:41.960
<i>M-My soul might snap...</i>

12:42.600 --> 12:44.250
What are you doing?

12:44.250 --> 12:47.300
Don't go acting weird in my home.

12:47.950 --> 12:49.910
Wh-What?

12:54.840 --> 12:56.830
<i>Using her feminine charm, I see.</i>

12:56.830 --> 12:59.630
<i>That's not going to break me.</i>

12:59.630 --> 13:03.800
<i>If anything... It's only making 
my horn even more vicious!</i>

13:06.290 --> 13:08.850
I'll fight back before 
he gets a chance to end me!

13:15.810 --> 13:18.100
How could you dress like that?!

13:18.100 --> 13:22.400
I get loosening up when you get home, 
but don't undress completely!

13:22.400 --> 13:24.880
Huh? You've got the wrong idea.

13:24.880 --> 13:26.460
I'm properly dressed.

13:26.920 --> 13:27.820
Thank goodness.

13:27.820 --> 13:29.050
She's dressed.

13:30.340 --> 13:31.240
There.

13:31.240 --> 13:33.980
What's wrong with you? 
Are your eyes just circles?

13:33.980 --> 13:38.040
No, it's just that I didn't expect 
anything so proper.

13:38.740 --> 13:42.540
I see. You thought I didn't 
know how to cook, did you?

13:42.540 --> 13:43.820
How rude.

13:43.820 --> 13:46.630
I have no trouble living on my own, 
believe it or not.

13:47.940 --> 13:49.610
You can get started.

13:50.660 --> 13:51.940
Okay.

13:52.560 --> 13:55.020
<i>It looks proper, but...</i>

13:55.360 --> 13:58.140
<i>It could turn out to be devastatingly bad.</i>

14:01.670 --> 14:02.680
It's good!

14:02.680 --> 14:05.050
<i>I never would have expected this 
from how Amane is usually.</i>

14:05.050 --> 14:06.300
<i>It's delicate and not overly strong.</i>

14:06.300 --> 14:10.680
<i>The domestic and modest scent 
gently invades my inner nasal cavity.</i>

14:10.680 --> 14:13.290
<i>Like wasabi, the stimulation suddenly stops,</i>

14:13.290 --> 14:17.500
<i>at which point, oh so mischievously, the durum 
semolina's firm texture tackles me!</i>

14:17.500 --> 14:19.000
Well?

14:19.000 --> 14:20.480
Not bad, is it?

14:20.480 --> 14:22.080
More like...

14:22.080 --> 14:23.500
It's really good.

14:23.500 --> 14:26.200
I'm confident in my pasta.

14:26.200 --> 14:28.130
That's just an appetizer, by the way.

14:28.130 --> 14:29.830
Here's the main dish.

14:33.220 --> 14:34.890
Time to eat.

14:34.890 --> 14:36.930
Amane, can I ask you something?

14:37.920 --> 14:39.100
What?

14:39.100 --> 14:40.920
Do you like pasta?

14:42.920 --> 14:44.610
Isn't it obvious?

14:44.990 --> 14:46.700
I basically eat pasta twice a day,

14:46.700 --> 14:48.860
about four days a week.

14:48.860 --> 14:50.860
What are you, a dude living on his own?

14:50.860 --> 14:53.110
You should think about balance more.

14:53.960 --> 14:57.200
What do you usually eat, then?

14:57.200 --> 14:58.790
Let's see...

14:59.240 --> 15:00.620
Bell peppers.

15:01.140 --> 15:03.220
Bell peppers are great.

15:03.630 --> 15:07.580
They're nice in tempura, and stuffed 
with meat, they're absolutely the best.

15:07.580 --> 15:10.600
Or you could chop one up
 real thin for chinjao rosu...

15:10.600 --> 15:12.430
B-Bell peppers?!

15:12.430 --> 15:13.510
What?

15:14.850 --> 15:17.870
That's not even a dish! 
Your first thought was an ingredient?!

15:17.870 --> 15:19.820
Don't make fun of bell peppers!

15:21.280 --> 15:22.810
They can be a main dish <i>or</i> a side!

15:22.810 --> 15:24.220
They're the ultimate soldier!

15:24.220 --> 15:26.860
I guess they could be a side, but a main dish?!

15:26.860 --> 15:28.870
What, are you going to eat one whole?

15:30.030 --> 15:32.700
Damn it, enough laughing!

15:33.890 --> 15:35.720
It wasn't that funny!

15:37.320 --> 15:39.260
Wait, is this just your sense of humor?!

15:40.870 --> 15:42.870
H-Hey, are you okay?!

15:44.980 --> 15:46.130
Hey...

15:48.000 --> 15:49.220
Yeah...

15:56.030 --> 15:58.930
There's nothing we can do 
under these circumstances.

15:59.280 --> 16:01.930
Yeah. I agree.

16:02.910 --> 16:03.730
Here.

16:03.730 --> 16:05.000
What's this?

16:05.000 --> 16:06.920
A little something for after dinner.

16:06.920 --> 16:09.210
Although we haven't done dessert yet.

16:10.490 --> 16:12.170
I haven't watched this yet!

16:12.170 --> 16:13.450
Let's watch this!

16:13.450 --> 16:15.310
No! I already watched it!

16:15.310 --> 16:17.320
You can watch it again.

16:17.320 --> 16:18.700
It's an action movie.

16:18.700 --> 16:20.840
No means no!

16:20.840 --> 16:23.250
There's too many bugs!

16:23.250 --> 16:24.080
Ah.

16:25.240 --> 16:27.040
You hate bugs, huh?

16:27.040 --> 16:31.280
I-I can deal with one, but not a bunch.

16:31.280 --> 16:32.160
Okay, let's—

16:32.160 --> 16:33.340
H-Hey!

16:34.960 --> 16:35.900
Here.

16:35.900 --> 16:37.550
Thanks.

16:37.550 --> 16:41.560
<b>Dog</b>

16:37.550 --> 16:41.560
<b>Cat</b>

16:38.450 --> 16:41.560
Do you prefer caramel or salt?

16:41.560 --> 16:43.080
<i>Give it back!</i>

16:41.870 --> 16:43.440
Caramel.

16:43.080 --> 16:45.060
<i>Come on, just do your best to watch!</i>

16:45.060 --> 16:46.510
<i>I said I can't!</i>

16:46.510 --> 16:49.420
<i>You </i>must<i> have 
to deal with bugs if you live alone!</i>

16:49.420 --> 16:50.780
<i>The movie will help you get over it!</i>

16:50.780 --> 16:53.450
<i>They don't come this high up!</i>

16:54.920 --> 16:58.450
<i>Why don't you two, like, 
just figure it out yourselves?</i>

17:06.040 --> 17:10.750
<i>I didn't think she'd rent 
a romance movie, though.</i>

17:10.750 --> 17:13.880
<i>I guess she's still a girl, 
even if she's an angel.</i>

17:18.900 --> 17:21.140
<i>Maybe it's because it's dark, 
but she's even more...</i>

17:21.600 --> 17:23.850
<i>This mood's dangerous.</i>

17:23.850 --> 17:24.680
<i>Wait...</i>

17:24.680 --> 17:26.340
<i>Romance movie means...</i>

17:27.960 --> 17:29.230
<i>Here we go!</i>

17:29.720 --> 17:32.270
<i>But it's light enough that...</i>

17:32.270 --> 17:34.030
<i>It's light enough that...</i>

17:34.030 --> 17:36.280
<i>Light enough that...</i>

17:36.280 --> 17:38.200
<i>Get it over with, already! Stop it!</i>

17:38.200 --> 17:40.140
<i>Okay, okay, good.</i>

17:40.140 --> 17:41.310
<i>You can...</i>

17:42.200 --> 17:43.820
<i>Don't do it!</i>

17:46.320 --> 17:47.900
<i>They did the thing!</i>

17:47.900 --> 17:50.360
<i>How could you do that in front of 
a teenage boy and girl?!</i>

17:51.090 --> 17:53.820
<i>The awkwardness could do 
two laps around the planet.</i>

17:51.090 --> 17:55.130
<b>Please stand by</b>

17:53.820 --> 17:56.970
<i>Jeez, why would she rent something like this?</i>

18:07.360 --> 18:08.720
<i>Wh-What was that?</i>

18:08.720 --> 18:11.650
<i>That was, er, weirdly hot.</i>

18:12.130 --> 18:14.150
<i>Nah, no way.</i>

18:14.150 --> 18:16.990
<i>This is Amane we're talking about. I mean...</i>

18:22.050 --> 18:23.120
What?!

18:23.120 --> 18:24.990
Wh-What to you, too!

18:25.290 --> 18:29.710
I-I was just looking at the clock.

18:29.710 --> 18:31.920
S-Sure.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.640
I was just tilting my head, too.

18:35.340 --> 18:36.600
I see.

18:36.600 --> 18:37.690
Yeah.

18:42.180 --> 18:45.060
I-I'm going to get drinks.

19:03.530 --> 19:05.210
S-Sorry.

19:05.210 --> 19:06.220
Are you all right?

19:24.450 --> 19:26.190
<i>This is bad.</i>

19:26.190 --> 19:28.310
<i>My body won't listen to me.</i>

19:29.120 --> 19:30.870
<i>My brain isn't working.</i>

19:31.540 --> 19:33.610
<i>My mouth is dry.</i>

19:37.780 --> 19:39.320
Akutsu...

19:39.320 --> 19:42.070
<i>Amane, why...</i>

19:43.750 --> 19:47.110
<i>Why don't you run?</i>

19:48.630 --> 19:51.260
<i>Why don't you insult me like always?</i>

19:52.610 --> 19:54.330
<i>Why are you...</i>

19:55.670 --> 19:57.110
<i>Gazing at me?</i>

20:11.390 --> 20:12.540
<i>No...</i>

20:13.150 --> 20:14.900
<i>I'm getting sucked in.</i>

20:28.910 --> 20:30.600
M-My phone!

20:28.910 --> 20:30.910
Alarm

20:30.600 --> 20:32.010
It's mine.

20:32.010 --> 20:33.930
O-Oh...

20:33.930 --> 20:35.070
So...

20:35.790 --> 20:37.840
Would you mind getting out of the way?

20:37.840 --> 20:38.940
Sorry!

20:47.300 --> 20:49.940
Look at the time.

20:53.690 --> 20:58.690
Pfss, pfsss...

20:55.360 --> 20:58.690
Hey, I should get going.

20:58.690 --> 21:00.350
Y-Yeah.

21:00.350 --> 21:01.820
Get home safe.

21:02.500 --> 21:03.640
Yeah...

21:07.800 --> 21:08.720
Yes.

21:08.720 --> 21:11.300
That ends my scheduled report.

21:16.470 --> 21:19.380
<i>What was I doing?</i>

21:24.320 --> 21:26.590
<i>I'm still ruffled.</i>

21:32.500 --> 21:34.090
<i>Something's wrong.</i>

21:34.090 --> 21:36.470
<i>It's not like how it was before.</i>

21:37.140 --> 21:40.390
<i>Every time I think about it, my chest aches.</i>

21:43.740 --> 21:45.800
<i>What the hell was I doing?</i>

21:46.200 --> 21:48.330
<i>She's an angel.</i>

21:49.610 --> 21:52.730
<i>Amane was cute, though.</i>

21:56.280 --> 21:58.040
<i>I'm still not calming down.</i>

21:58.580 --> 21:59.670
Wait...

22:00.030 --> 22:01.590
This isn't...

22:01.590 --> 22:03.590
Don't tell me...

22:04.770 --> 22:07.740
<i>I've fallen for him?!</i>

22:04.770 --> 22:07.740
<i>I've fallen for her?!</i>
